{"docs":[{"id":12,"adminTitle":"O nás","title":"O nás","heroTitle":"Pomáháme lidem *plnit sny*","description":"Česká poradenská skupina s více než 20letou tradicí. Pojištění, finance, reality a vlastní likvidace škod pod jednou střechou - v Česku i na Slovensku.","heroPhoto":{"id":508,"alt":"Allrisk","visibility":"public","folder":1483,"updatedAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.260Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.260Z","url":"/allrisk-web-prototyp/media/o-nas-hero.jpg","thumbnailURL":null,"filename":"o-nas-hero.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","filesize":227732,"width":1800,"height":1274,"focalX":50,"focalY":50},"heroVideo":null,"heroStills":[],"heroPoints":[{"id":"96549933239cf6d77b94c4be","icon":"IconHistory","text":"Více než 23 let na trhu"},{"id":"03b515e151475f3a2b71e2aa","icon":"IconUsers","text":"Staráme se o více než 240 000 klientů"},{"id":"23f3db58fa245a45f0483322","icon":"IconBuildingStore","text":"70+ poboček po ČR a SK"}],"heroButtons":[{"id":"6ad16a6dc29616c3d89caf9f","icon":null,"iconAfter":"IconArrowUpRight","variant":"primary","linkType":"doc","url":null,"newTab":null,"label":"Kontakty a pobočky","doc":{"relationTo":"allrisk-pages","value":{"id":9,"adminTitle":"Kontakty","title":"Kontakty","heroTitle":"*Kontakty* a pobočky","description":"Navštivte nás v některé z našich poboček po celé republice. Můžete nás kontaktovat telefonicky, napsat e-mail nebo se jednoduše zastavit osobně. Náš tým je vždy připraven zodpovědět vaše dotazy a pomoci vám dál.","heroPhoto":{"id":274,"alt":"Jan, 28 let","visibility":"public","folder":1233,"updatedAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:27.355Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:27.355Z","url":"/allrisk-web-prototyp/media/kontakty-hero.jpg","thumbnailURL":null,"filename":"kontakty-hero.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","filesize":191657,"width":1600,"height":1068,"focalX":50,"focalY":50},"isActive":true,"segment":"general","slug":"kontakty","translationState":null,"translationInput":null,"updatedAt":"2026-11-11T12:24:45.843Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:48.342Z","_status":"published"}}},{"id":"6ad16a6dc29616c3d89cafa0","icon":null,"iconAfter":null,"variant":"outline","linkType":"doc","url":null,"newTab":null,"label":"Reference klientů","doc":{"relationTo":"allrisk-pages","value":{"id":10,"adminTitle":"Reference","title":"Reference","heroTitle":"Co říkají *klienti*","description":"Zkušenosti lidí, kteří s námi řeší pojištění, finance i reality. Bez filtrů a bez vybraných výjimek.","heroPhoto":{"id":472,"alt":"Reference","visibility":"public","folder":1480,"updatedAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:37.202Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:37.202Z","url":"/allrisk-web-prototyp/media/reference-hero.jpg","thumbnailURL":null,"filename":"reference-hero.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","filesize":264251,"width":1800,"height":1200,"focalX":50,"focalY":50},"isActive":true,"segment":"general","slug":"reference","translationState":null,"translationInput":null,"updatedAt":"2026-11-11T12:24:45.880Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:48.363Z","_status":"published"}}}],"content":{"root":{"type":"root","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"type":"block","fields":{"id":"ac0b0760c7cd055acc969b77","label":"Jsme Allrisk","photo":{"id":509,"alt":"Zakladatelé společnosti Allrisk","visibility":"public","folder":1483,"updatedAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.288Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.288Z","url":"/allrisk-web-prototyp/media/o-nas-founders.jpg","thumbnailURL":null,"filename":"o-nas-founders.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","filesize":121378,"width":652,"height":900,"focalX":50,"focalY":50},"title":"Partner, který stojí *na vaší straně*","anchor":null,"content":{"root":{"type":"root","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"Svět financí může být složitý a my v Allrisku jsme tu proto, abyste v něm nikdy nebyli sami. Nejsme jen finanční makléř - jsme partner, který stojí na vaší straně. Jako česká poradenská skupina s více než 20letou tradicí pečujeme o statisíce klientů. Naše práce stojí na důvěře, odbornosti a schopnosti být skutečně nablízku.","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":"ltr","textStyle":"","textFormat":0},{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"Naší silou je ekosystém odborníků, technologií a partnerských institucí. S klíčovými bankami, pojišťovnami a stavebními spořitelnami hledáme řešení na míru. Díky síti klientských center jsme dostupní v Česku i na Slovensku. Jako registrovaný nezávislý likvidátor pojistných událostí spolupracujeme se znalci a právními odborníky i tam, kde jde o víc než jen čísla.","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":"ltr","textStyle":"","textFormat":0},{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"Jiří Toman & Ing. Ondřej Polák","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1},{"type":"linebreak","version":1},{"mode":"normal","text":"zakladatelé společnosti","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":"ltr","textStyle":"","textFormat":0}],"direction":"ltr"}},"photoFit":"contain","blockName":"","blockType":"section","photoSide":null,"background":null,"signatures":[{"id":510,"alt":"Podpis: Ing. Ondřej Polák","visibility":"public","folder":1483,"updatedAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.321Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.321Z","url":"/allrisk-web-prototyp/media/polak-signature.png","thumbnailURL":null,"filename":"polak-signature.png","mimeType":"image/png","filesize":5685,"width":288,"height":231,"focalX":50,"focalY":50},{"id":511,"alt":"Podpis: Jiří Toman","visibility":"public","folder":1483,"updatedAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.346Z","createdAt":"2026-11-02T14:21:41.346Z","url":"/allrisk-web-prototyp/media/toman-signature.png","thumbnailURL":null,"filename":"toman-signature.png","mimeType":"image/png","filesize":10548,"width":326,"height":242,"focalX":50,"focalY":50}]},"format":"","ve